            {
              "id": "36e4e737",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div style='padding:60px 0'>\n  <p style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#ffed00;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px' id='contacto'>CONTACTO</p>\n  <h2 style='font-family:Barlow,\"Arial Black\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,38px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px;text-wrap:balance'>Hablemos de tu lubricante ideal</h2>\n  <p style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin-bottom:32px;max-width:440px'>Nuestro equipo técnico y comercial te orienta para elegir la referencia correcta y encontrar el distribuidor más cercano.</p>\n  <ul style='list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px'>\n    <li style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'>\n      <span style='font-size:20px'>📞</span>\n      <div>\n        <div style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:2px'>Teléfono</div>\n        <a href='tel:+582121234567' style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600'>+58 212 123 4567</a>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'>\n      <span style='font-size:20px'>✉️</span>\n      <div>\n        <div style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:2px'>Correo</div>\n        <a href='mailto:ventas@venoco.com' style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#ffed00;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600'>ventas@venoco.com</a>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'>\n      <span style='font-size:20px'>📍</span>\n      <div>\n        <div style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:2px'>Ubicación</div>\n        <div style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#fff;font-weight:600'>Caracas, Venezuela</div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'>\n      <span style='font-size:20px'>🕐</span>\n      <div>\n        <div style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:2px'>Horario</div>\n        <div style='font-family:Barlow,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#fff;font-weight:600'>Lunes a viernes: 8 a.m. – 5 p.m.</div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
